{"availability":"available","full":"playbridgeapp/playbridge","name":"playbridge","description":"Open-source casting suite (alpha) — browse on your phone, play on the big screen: Android TV, Apple TV, or desktop (macOS/Windows/Linux). Local-network, GPLv3.","category":"Other","language":"Kotlin","stars":353,"forks":22,"created":"2026-06-03T19:49:13Z","updated":"2026-10-03T22:02:03Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://playbridge.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://playbridge.app/cast-demo/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.038Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.038Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.038Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.038Z","stars":353,"forks":22}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["PlayBridge is an open-source casting suite: browse on your phone, play on the big screen. Find your content on your phone — in the built-in browser or your media library — and bridge it to Android TV / Fire TV, Apple TV, a desktop receiver (macOS, Windows, Linux), or any DLNA-capable TV with nothing installed on it. Local-network only, no account, no cloud.","PlayBridge is in alpha. It's under active early development — expect bugs, incomplete features, and breaking changes between releases. Feedback and issue reports are very welcome."],"features":["Browse & detect: a full phone browser (GeckoView, with built-in ad-blocking) that detects videos on the page — direct files, HLS, DASH, and MSE/blob players — and casts them with one tap.","Library & discovery: a Stremio-style library with catalogs, add-ons (including sandboxed JavaScript scrapers), a watchlist, and Collections; pick an episode and send it straight to the TV.","Cast anywhere: native receivers for Android TV / Fire TV, Apple TV, and desktop — or cast to any DLNA/UPnP renderer without installing anything on it.","Binge-ready: episode queue with lazy auto-advance, watch-progress tracking, and resume (\"Resume · 23:14\") that actually seeks the TV to where you left off.","Phone as remote: touchpad, D-pad, keyboard, and transport controls, context-aware for the browser and player."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/playbridgeapp/playbridge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1ed1014de6337d52ade92cd39cb0f4827884d4ad1b85efef84f09a7c68086bac","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.197Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.197Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"PlayBridge is an open-source casting suite: browse on your phone, play on the big screen. Find your content on your phone — in the built-in browser or your media library — and bridge it to Android TV / Fire TV, Apple TV, a desktop receiver (macOS, Windows, Linux), or any DLNA-capable TV with nothing installed on it. Local-network only, no account, no cloud.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/playbridgeapp/playbridge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Local-network only, no account, no cloud.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/playbridgeapp/playbridge/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Private by design: everything stays on your local network — no account, no cloud, GPLv3.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/playbridgeapp/playbridge/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1ed1014de6337d52ade92cd39cb0f4827884d4ad1b85efef84f09a7c68086bac","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/playbridgeapp/playbridge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.198Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T22:02:03Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/playbridgeapp/playbridge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:15.199Z","hash":"1ed1014de6337d52ade92cd39cb0f4827884d4ad1b85efef84f09a7c68086bac","originalBytes":26953,"storedBytes":26953,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["receiver","browser","phone","playbridge","desktop","app","android","cast","extension","sender","ope